  "notes": "{目立|めだ}つ means to stand out or be conspicuous. It's formed from ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧ (eye) + ⟦{立|た}つ→立つ：00758_tatsu⟧ (to stand).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Something stands out on its own\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {目立|めだ}つ⟦{色|いろ}→色：00849_iro⟧: conspicuous color\n- {目立|めだ}たない: inconspicuous, not noticeable\n- {目立|めだ}って: noticeably, conspicuously\n- ⟦{目立|めだ}ちたがる→目立ちたがる：noentry⟧: to want to stand out\n\nEXAMPLES:\n- ⟦{赤|あか}い→赤い：00585_akai⟧⟦{服|ふく}→服：00695_fuku⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{目立|めだ}つ: Red clothes stand out\n- ⟦{傷|きず}→傷：02201_kizu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{目立|めだ}つ: The scratch is noticeable\n- ⟦あまり→あまり：00604_amari⟧{目立|めだ}たないよう⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧: so as not to stand out\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {目立|めだ}たない: inconspicuous\n- ⟦{派手|はで}→派手：03563_hade⟧: flashy, showy",
